      176.44,
      465.06,
      426.24,
      476.13
    ],
    "text": "NATIONAL ENVIRONMENTAL ACT, No. 47 OF 1980",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      211.43,
      489.06,
      393.57,
      500.13
    ],
    "text": "Order under Section 24C and Section 24D",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      513.06,
      549.77,
      536.13
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 24C and Section 24D of the National Environmental Act, No. 47 of 1980 read with Article 44(3) of the Constitution I, Ranil Wickramasinghe, President, do by this Order, declare-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      72.25,
      549.06,
      549.79,
      584.13
    ],
    "text": "(a) That the area of land in which the metes and bounds are set out in the Schedule I hereto shall be an Environmental Protection Area for the purposes of the Act and shall be called the \u201c Warnagalawatta Environmental Protection Area\u201d (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cProtection Area\u201d);",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      72.25,
      597.06,
      256.33,
      608.13
    ],
    "text": "(b) That for so long as this Order is in force -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      621.06,
      549.76,
      644.13
    ],
    "text": "(i) Any planning scheme or project within the Protection Area which is in con\ufb02 ict with the provisions of the aforesaid Act, shall cease to operate in the Protection Area from the date of operation of this Order;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      657.06,
      549.76,
      680.13
    ],
    "text": "(ii) No person other than the Authority shall exercise, perform, and discharge any powers, duties or functions relating to the planning and development within the Protection Area:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      109.25,
      693.06,
      549.77,
      716.13
    ],
    "text": "Provided that, where the Authority delegates any of its powers, duties or functions relating to the planning and development within the Protection Area to any Government Department, corporation, statutory board, local",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      47.97,
      84.31,
      518.22,
      108.67
    ],
    "text": "I fldgi: (I) fPoh \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2024'06'05P\u0d7a\u0d8b\u0d8d I: S\u0d7e\u0d7c. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 05.06.2024 2A",
    "fonts": [
      "FMAbabldBold",
      "MinionPro-Regular",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      101.97,
      114.22,
      542.49,
      147.29
    ],
    "text": "authority or any public o\ufb03 cer under the provisions of Section 26. such Government Department, corporation, statuary board, local authority or public o\ufb03 cer may exercise, perform and discharge such powers, duties and functions subject to the provisions of the said Section; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      47.97,
      158.22,
      542.5,
      191.29
    ],
    "text": "(iii) The powers, duties or functions of the Authority relating to physical planning and development within the Protection Area, shall be limited to the activities set out in Part I of the Schedule II hereto and shall be exercised, performed and discharged subject to the conditions set out in Part II of the Schedule II hereto.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      61.97,
      202.22,
      118.9,
      213.29
    ],
    "text": "In this Order -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      61.97,
      224.22,
      328.6,
      235.29
    ],
    "text": "\u201cAct\u201d means the National Environmental Act, No. 47 of 1980; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      60.97,
      246.22,
      542.5,
      268.29
    ],
    "text": "\u201cAuthority\u201d means the Central Environmental Authority established under Section 2 of the National Environmental Act, No. 47 of 1980.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      47.97,
      279.22,
      491.82,
      301.29
    ],
    "text": "R\u0d7a\u0d87\u0d82\u0d85 W\u0d82\u0d7c\u0d84\u0d8b\u0d7e\u0d86\u0d7e\u0d8c\u0d82\u0d87\u0d80\u0d7e, President.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
