      47.97,
      389.22,
      264.66,
      400.29
    ],
    "text": "1. Extent of the Protection Area is 502.69 hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      47.97,
      411.22,
      542.52,
      444.29
    ],
    "text": "2. The Protection Area is situated in Adavikanda Grama Niladhari Division in Kuruwita Divisional Secretariat in Ratnapura District and in Magala Grama Niladhari Division in Deraniyagala Divisional Secretariat in Kegalle District in the Sabaragamuwa Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
