  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      269.1,
      116.08,
      333.39,
      127.15
    ],
    "text": "SCHEDULE II",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      288.86,
      140.08,
      313.63,
      151.15
    ],
    "text": "Part I",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      203.62,
      164.08,
      398.89,
      175.15
    ],
    "text": "Activities permitted within the Protection Area",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      188.08,
      480.76,
      199.15
    ],
    "text": "The physical planning and development within the Protection Area shall be only for the following activitics:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      212.08,
      549.78,
      331.15
    ],
    "text": "1. Maintenance of existing infrastructure and buildings (two-religious places, two - Ambalamas, Erathna - Sripada Road and Pilgrims Support Facilitating Centres). 2. Operation and maintenance of existing mini hydro power project. 3. Management of invasive alien species. 4. Educational and Research activities. 5. Excavation, conservation and maintenance of Archeological sites. 6. Construction and maintenance of vehicle park proposed by the Ministry of Provincial Roads Development, Rural Infrastructure, Tourism, Sports and Youth A\ufb00 airs in the Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council. 7. Maintenance activities of existing road from Erathna to mini hydro power project at Warnagala. 8. Activities related to the sustainability of the Protection Area.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      286.97,
      344.08,
      315.53,
      355.15
    ],
    "text": "Part II",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      66.68,
      368.08,
      535.82,
      379.15
    ],
    "text": "Conditions to be applied in carrying out the activities set out in Part I of this Schedule within the Protection Area",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      72.25,
      392.08,
      549.75,
      415.15
    ],
    "text": "1. Any physical planning and development set out in Part I of this Schedule shall be carried out subject to the following conditions:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      91.25,
      428.08,
      484.96,
      439.15
    ],
    "text": "(a) such physical planning and development shall be carried out subject to the provisions of the Act;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      91.25,
      452.08,
      537.89,
      475.15
    ],
    "text": "(b) results of such educational and research activities shall be submitted to the Authority along with a copy of the study or research report;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      91.25,
      488.08,
      429.88,
      499.15
    ],
    "text": "(c) such physical planning and development shall be carried out in such manner as to-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      91.25,
      512.08,
      348.8,
      523.15
    ],
    "text": "(i) not hinder the sustainability of the Protection Area; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      91.25,
      536.08,
      268.67,
      547.15
    ],
    "text": "(ii) not disturb fauna and \ufb02 ora habitats;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      91.25,
      560.08,
      374.61,
      571.15
    ],
    "text": "(d) invasive alien species shall not be introduced to the Protection Area;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      91.25,
      584.08,
      408.64,
      595.15
    ],
    "text": "(e) any kind of waste or wastewater shall not be disposed to the Protection Area;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      91.25,
      608.08,
      519.66,
      631.15
    ],
    "text": "(f) reclamation of land, activities relevant to land degradation and soil erosion shall not be undertaken in the Protection Area; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      644.08,
      549.77,
      727.15
    ],
    "text": "(g) su\ufb03 cient environmental \ufb02 ow shall be maintained in downstream of the Kuru Ganga from weir of the existing mini hydro power project. 2. Where any Government Department, corporation, statutory board, local authority or any public o\ufb03 cer carries out any physical planning and development within the Protection Area under the provisions of section 26, the Authority shall prepare and adopt an administrative levy scheme in order to process and evaluate project proposals relating to such physical planning and development and shall monitor such activities.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      47.97,
      84.31,
      518.22,
      108.67
    ],
    "text": "I fldgi: (I) fPoh \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2024'06'05P\u0d7a\u0d8b\u0d8d I: S\u0d7e\u0d7c. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 05.06.2024 6A",
    "fonts": [
      "FMAbabldBold",
      "MinionPro-Regular",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      64.97,
      126.22,
      542.5,
      161.29
    ],
    "text": "3. The Authority may, subject to paragraph (j) of section 10 of the Act, appoint a committee which shall be known as the \u201c Warnagalawatta Environmental Protection Area Management and Monitoring Committee to assist the Authority in the performance of its function relating to the planning and development within the Protection Area.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      64.97,
      174.22,
      211.42,
      185.29
    ],
    "text": "4. Such committee shall consist of-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      83.97,
      198.22,
      516.69,
      209.29
    ],
    "text": "(a) the Divisional Secretary of Kuruwita Divisional Secretariat who shall be the Chairman of such committee;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      83.97,
      222.22,
      521.94,
      245.29
    ],
    "text": "(b) an Assistant Director of the Authority appointed by the Director General who shall be the Secretary of such committee;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      83.97,
      258.22,
      402.08,
      269.29
    ],
    "text": "(c) the Assistant Divisional Secretary of the Deraniyagala Divisional Secretariat;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      83.97,
      282.22,
      290.77,
      293.29
    ],
    "text": "(d) the Secretary of the Kuruwita Pradeshiya Sabha;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      83.97,
      306.22,
      539.18,
      329.29
    ],
    "text": "(e) an o\ufb03 cer not below the rank of an Assistant Director of the Department of Wildlife Conservation nominated by the Director General of such Department;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      83.97,
      342.22,
      531.63,
      365.29
    ],
    "text": "(f) an o\ufb03 cer not below the rank of an Assistant Director of the Department of Forest Conservation nominated by the Conservator General of Forest of such Department;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      83.97,
      378.22,
      512.67,
      401.29
    ],
    "text": "(g) an o\ufb03 cer not below the rank of an Assistant Director of the Department of Archeology nominated by the Director General of such Department;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      83.97,
      414.22,
      512.34,
      437.29
    ],
    "text": "(h) an o\ufb03 cer not below the rank of an Assistant Director of the Land Reform Commission nominated by the Director General of such Commission;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      83.97,
      450.22,
      542.52,
      473.29
    ],
    "text": "(i) an o\ufb03 cer not below the rank of an Assistant Director of the Department of Land Use Policy Planning nominated by the Director General of such Department; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      83.97,
      486.22,
      517.11,
      509.29
    ],
    "text": "(j) such other o\ufb03 cers not below the rank of an Assistant Director of any Governmental Institution, as may be necessary, as determined by the Authority",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      187.71,
      761.32,
      400.59,
      767.97
    ],
    "text": "PRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.0
    ]
  },
